WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:10.000
White light fades. The world returns.

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Squall lies unconscious on bare rock, eyes closed, Griever chain at his chest.

3
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:45.000
Rinoa cradles him, searching his face with desperate eyes. He does not stir.

4
00:00:50.000 --> 00:01:00.000
She holds him close, willing him to wake. The sky is grey and still.

5
00:01:10.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Elsewhere, a red fishing bobber sits on calm blue water. A line trails from it.

6
00:01:25.000 --> 00:01:35.000
Seifer looks down from a pier, his grey coat open to the breeze. He is at peace.

7
00:01:40.000 --> 00:01:50.000
An open hand holds Rinoa's ring in warm sunlight, green grass all around.

8
00:01:55.000 --> 00:02:05.000
Squall has recovered. He and Rinoa embrace under the night sky.

9
00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:25.000
Close-up of Squall's face over Rinoa's shoulder. For the first time, he smiles.

10
00:02:30.000 --> 00:02:45.000
Laguna stands in a green field under blue sky, wearing a casual shirt. He smiles warmly.

11
00:02:50.000 --> 00:03:00.000
The scene fades. Flowers drift on a breeze.

12
00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:15.000
Credits begin. Names scroll on the right in red and white text.

13
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:30.000
A small camcorder window appears, showing celebration footage at Balamb Garden.

14
00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:40.000
The party continues in the camcorder. Friends gather and cheer on the Garden balcony.

15
00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:15.000
Credits near their end. The camcorder captures Rinoa stepping onto a balcony at night.

16
00:06:30.000 --> 00:06:45.000
Through the viewfinder, she looks up at the stars. The battery indicator blinks low.

17
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:50.000
The screen fades to black. The story of Squall and Rinoa is complete.
